            Prices change constantly, especially on Amazon, so treat these as rough ranges. The quick way to check any tub yourself is to divide the price by the number of servings, divide that by the grams of protein per serving, and multiply by 25. If the answer is far above 2 dollars, you are paying for format, flavor or branding rather than protein.
